Derivative note
---------------
Eta-Refined reworks only the UI/UX and engineering (Mist Glass design token
layer, first-run onboarding wizard, unified error messages, documentation and
release workflow). All business functionality and core system integration are
inherited from the upstream Eta project. Eta-Refined is an unofficial
derivative and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the
original author.

The UI/UX design language is informed by the dsh-Go project
(https://github.com/ccch1mneyyy/dsh-Go, AGPL-3.0). Only design ideas are
referenced; no source code is copied, synchronized, or merged from that project.

